#. settings-schema.json->hinweis-sensoren->description
msgid ""
"“Automatic” picks a suitable sensor by itself. The list shows every sensor "
"on this machine with its reading at the time of detection. It is refreshed "
"after “Detect hardware again”."
msgstr ""

